9.2  COMMUNITY CONSULTATION for TK CS / TK SS / clan / sacred material.
     Silence is not consent.

============================================================================
10. PROHIBITED USES
============================================================================

  (a) AI training (Section 5); (b) unauthorized commercial use (TK NC);
  (c) misappropriation/distortion of cultural expression; (d) moral-rights
  violations (17 U.S.C. § 106A where applicable; contract otherwise);
  (e) harm or exploitation of Indigenous communities or knowledge;
  (f) military or weapons development, including naval weapons, maritime
  domain surveillance, and autonomous-vessel targeting; (g) appropriation or
  stereotyping; (h) unconsented mining/scraping/extraction; (i) violation of
  Community Protocols; (j) disrespect of spiritual/cultural significance;
  (k) facilitating alienation of Cultural Patrimony, burial sites, remains,
  or sacred objects (Section 8); (l) surveillance/biometric exploitation
  (5.5); (m) maritime interference with Treaty-Protected Interests (7.3);
  (n) CMI removal (3.3).

